      "content": "Your feelings are deeply valid and shared by many who ponder the cosmic scale of things. Philosophers and thinkers have faced these existential questions for centuries, often concluding that while the universe may not regard our actions, the individual pursuit of meaning and quality is intrinsically valuable. Seeking connection, creating compassion, and touching lives can transcend cosmic insignificance and stir value through the lives you influence and the moments you share. Ultimately, meaning is chosen and can inspire unique and passioned lives even in the face of cosmic indifference.",
      "source": "target",
